#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:2
msgid "PaHub Unit"
msgstr "PaHub Unit"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:7
msgid "PaHub Unit is an I2C hub used to connect multiple I2C Units to one host I2C bus."
msgstr "PaHub Unit 是一款 I2C 集线器，用于将多个 I2C Unit 连接到一个主机 I2C 总线。"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:11
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:13
msgid "|PaHubUnit|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/refs/unit.pahub.ref:0
msgid "PaHubUnit"
msgstr "PaHubUnit"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:17
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:24
msgid "Add **Unit PaHub**."
msgstr "添加 **Unit PaHub**。"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:26
msgid "Set the PaHub address. The address must match the actual DIP switch setting on the PaHub hardware."
msgstr "设置 PaHub 地址。地址需要与 PaHub 硬件上的实际拨码开关设置一致。"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:29
msgid "Add the other I2C Unit connected to Unit PaHub."
msgstr "添加其他连接到 Unit PaHub 的 I2C Unit。"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:31
msgid "In the connected Unit configuration, select **Bus: PAHUB**, then select the PaHub port/channel number that the Unit is connected to."
msgstr "在已连接 Unit 的配置中，选择 **Bus: PAHUB**，然后选择该 Unit 实际连接的 PaHub 端口/通道号。"

#: ../../source/unit/pahub.rst:34
msgid "The default PaHub address is ``0x70``. If the DIP switch changes the hardware address, update the address setting in UiFlow2 to the same value."
msgstr "PaHub 默认地址为 ``0x70``。如果通过拨码开关修改了硬件地址，请在 UiFlow2 中将地址设置为相同的值。"
